xl <VERSION> — 65 verbs. `xl <verb> --help` shows a verb's options; `xl schema --json` prints this contract as JSON.
Globals (accepted anywhere on the command line): --json -f|--file -s|--sheet --max-size -o|--output -i|--in-place --backend --stream --no-recalc --preserve-caches --strict
NEEDS: -f an input workbook; -s ONE sheet (a qualified ref, else -s, else the only sheet of a single-sheet book); -o|-i an output; --stream runs in O(1) memory.
Exit codes:
  0  ok
  1  completed with findings or a failed gate (diff differs, lint findings, audit --fail-on-findings, --strict) — never a failure; with -o the file is written, with -i the input is left untouched
  2  usage — the command line is wrong; nothing read, nothing written
  3  failed — the operation could not complete; nothing written

